<title>ARGENTINA: RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA  BEAT ARGENTINA  46-15.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA  BEAT ARGENTINA  46-15.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Argentina</p>
<p>46-15 (halftime 17-8) in the first rugby union test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>South Africa - Tries: Andre Venter, Mark Andrews, Hennie Le</p>
<p>Roux, penalty try, James Small, Joost Van Der Westhuizen, Andre</p>
<p>Joubert. Conversions: Henry Honiball (3), Joubert. Penalties:</p>
<p>Honiball.</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Gonzalo Camardon, Rolando Martin.</p>
<p>Conversion: Jose Luis Cilley. Penalty: Cilley.</p>
<p>Attendance: 16,000</p>
</text>
